This implements the rgb-http-json-rpc v0.2 protocol, whose reference implementation is
rgb-proxy-server (https://github.com/RGB-Tools/rgb-proxy-server). No code from it is
included here; the error codes and response shapes are matched deliberately so that the
two are interchangeable for a client.
